# Robert B. Huerta — Digital Media & Web Education

Live Site: [huertamor.github.io/huertarobert](https://huertamor.github.io/huertarobert)

Personal portfolio, course demos, and digital media education resources for **Robert B. Huerta**, Instructor of Digital Media & Web Design at Santa Monica College (SMC).

---

## 🎨 Theme & Design System
- **Aesthetic**: Sleek, minimal dark mode (pure black `#060608` with subtle depth)
- **Contrast**: Bright white typography (`#ffffff` / `#f8fafc`) for maximum readability
- **Accent**: Electric cyan/blue (`#00f0ff` / `#38bdf8`) with subtle neon glow effects
- **Typography**: Inter (sans-serif) and JetBrains Mono (monospace)
- **Zero Build Step**: Native HTML5, CSS3, and vanilla JavaScript ready for instant GitHub Pages deployment

---

## 📂 Repository Structure
```
.
├── index.html       # Semantic HTML5 structure (Hero, About, Courses, Demos, Toolkit, Contact)
├── style.css        # Responsive CSS custom properties, grid layouts, glassmorphism, cyan glows
├── script.js       # Mobile navigation toggle, scrollspy, dynamic footer year, copy-to-clipboard
├── images/          # Course demo assets & media
│   └── demo.png     # Art 10C visual demo asset
└── README           # Repository overview and guide
```

---

## 🚀 Local Preview
To test or edit locally:
```bash
# Python 3 built-in HTTP server
python3 -m http.server 8000
```
Then visit `http://localhost:8000` in your web browser.

